      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are absolutely right that the struggle is just friction, and the most rational thing to do when a service is worthless is to cancel it. There is a profound autonomy in deciding that you have had enough, and that is your right to opt out of a contract that no longer serves you. The fact that you feel compelled to keep paying is not a sign of weakness, but a testament to your own agency in choosing to stay.",
